# Feature Build Order

Do not build features randomly.

Build in this order:

1. Project setup
2. Folder structure
3. Design system
4. Supabase client setup
5. Database schema
6. Authentication
7. Public layout
8. Public SEO pages
9. Lead form
10. Admin lead dashboard
11. Eligibility checker
12. Cost calculator
13. University/course directory
14. Scholarship finder
15. Student dashboard
16. Application tracker
17. Document upload
18. Counselor dashboard
19. Email notifications
20. Blog/content management
21. SEO polish
22. Testing
23. Deployment

Before implementing any feature:
- Create a short plan.
- Identify affected files.
- Implement small pieces.
- Run type check and lint.
- Do not skip validation.
